@section 15.4 | Water, Sanitation and Cleanliness

@q 10:47-48

**Bharat Nirman** (2005) had six parts: irrigation, **rural drinking water**, roads, housing, electrification and telephony. The **Jal Jeevan Mission** (15 August **2019**, Budget **2019-20**) aims at a **tap connection for every rural household** (Har Ghar Jal); about **80%** of rural homes had tap water by 2025, and the mission was extended to **2028**.

